    aiContent: {
      difficulty: 'Intermediate',
      considerations: [
        'Score more points than the opponent by capturing pairs of identical tiles (ten times pip value), triplets that sum to a multiple of ten (pip total), and sweeps (last two table tiles for 40 bonus).',
        'Row of tiles on table. Draw and capture from ends. Identical pair = capture (score 10x pips). Triplet summing to 10 = capture. Sweep (take last 2) = 40 bonus. Missed captures can be claimed by opponent.',
        'Capture from row ends only',
        'Pairs and multiples-of-10 triplets',
      ],
